msgid ""
"... step bump, step bump bump...\n"
"Ohhh hi there. I've been taking dance lessons, what do you think?\n"
"...\n"
"Well, thank you.\n"
"Unfortunately the other skeletons don't think the same.\n"
"How about you help me teach them a lesson?"
msgstr "……踏一步，碰，踏一步，碰碰……\n"
"哦哦，你好呀。我一直在上舞蹈课，你觉得怎么样？\n"
"……\n"
"嗯，谢谢你。\n"
"可惜其他骷髅不这么认为。\n"
"不如你帮我给他们点教训？"

